<mxCell id="c202" value="FK* = references public.users(id), outside this module's schema (not drawn in full). appl_id on config_consts and module_code on menus/tenant_modules are plain codes sharing the same controlled code space as CENTRAL.central_plan_modules.module_code — informational, never an enforced foreign key (§3B). This is the base of the platform's dependency graph: every other module's schema reads FROM here; nothing here reads from another module." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="836" width="900" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
